  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、君たち、ちょうどよかった、
ここはどこなんだい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, you there, good timing.
Where is this place?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　どこって……
&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;だけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? What do you mean,
"where"? It's &lt;Red&gt;Ethos's House&lt;White&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;？
聞いたことないなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Red&gt;Ethos's House&lt;White&gt;? I've
never heard of it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おかしいな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's strange...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの、エトちゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up, Ethos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここ、結界が張られてて、
ぼくの許可した人しか
人は近づけないはずなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's a barrier around here
that should keep out anyone
I haven't invited myself...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それ！　ドラグノフだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, hey, that's...!
Dragunov, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……あ、これね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh... Oh, this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>知ってるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もちろん！
僕たち“さすらい鍛冶同盟”の
中では知らない人間はいないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Of course! There's not a soul
in the Wandering Blacksmiths'
Union who wouldn't!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、
“さすらい鍛冶同盟”って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Wandering Blacksmiths'
Union"? What's that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>伝統的なドワーフの鍛冶技術を
後世に伝えようって連中の
集まりさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're a group of people trying
to keep traditional dwarven smithing
techniques alive in the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ドワーフって……
ずっと昔にいなくなった
ヤツらだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dwarven... So, those guys who
disappeared a long time ago?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、最後のドワーフ
って言われたギースの親父から
後、ドワーフは見なくなったな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, old man Aegis was said
to be the last dwarf, and no
one's seen one since him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ギース……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aegis...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このドラグノフは、
そのギースが作ったって
聞いたけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I heard Aegis made
this Dragunov, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、そうさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh, is that right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、なんか
ずいぶん錆びついてないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But, isn't it
pretty rusty?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、うん、だね。
使いものになんなくって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, yeah, it is. I haven't
been able to use it like this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、んじゃあ、
ちょっと貸してくれないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, then how about
you lend it me for a bit?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>僕が打ち直そう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll fix it up for you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>できるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can do that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……そこの
家の部屋を貸して
もらえないだろうか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... Mind if I just
borrow a room in
that house back there?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　あ、ああ、
いいぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Oh, uh, sure.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、んじゃあ、
ちょっと待っててくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, then, just
give me a minute!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282804</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……オレ、見てくる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm gonna go watch!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ぼくも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, me too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あの剣、
とても大切なものなんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Those swords are pretty
important to you, aren't they?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>282988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　あ、うん。
どうして？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Oh, yeah.
Why do you ask?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だって、あんなボロボロで、
普通、ずっと持ってたり
しないかなって思って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, they're so worn out, and so I
thought, normally, you wouldn't carry
something like that around with you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかもね。
……あれは父さんの形見</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, that's true. ...It's
a memento of my father.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お父さんの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your father?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、
一族に伝わるとても
大切なものなんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. They're really precious,
and they've been passed down
in a certain clan for a long time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなものを父さんは
私に残してくれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And my father
left them to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その技とともに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Along with those artes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;の技はお父さんに
教えてもらったものなんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you were taught your
artes by your father, &lt;Rody&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……護身のためにって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... To protect myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうして、あそこまで
厳しく教え込まされたのかな
って思ってたけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wondered why he went
so far out of his way to make
sure I learned them, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんなことがあったから
なんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, it must've been
because that happened.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>怖がらないでね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't get spooked by this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前に&lt;Red&gt;ユークリッド&lt;White&gt;で
たくさん人が殺された話、
聞いたでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You heard about all of
the people who got killed
in &lt;Red&gt;Euclid&lt;White&gt; before, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、うん、えっと、
確か誘拐犯だった人と
仲間だったっていう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, yeah... That was... Oh, you
said they were friends of the
people who kidnapped you, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、あれやったの、
うちの父さんだと思う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. It was probably
my father who killed them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>283956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>２０人もの人間を一太刀で
片付けるなんてうちの
父くらいにしかできないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My dad's one of the only people
who could've taken down twenty
men with a single stroke of a sword.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それって、&lt;Rody&gt;を
誘拐したその仕返しってこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, you're saying it was punishment
for them kidnapping you, &lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかな。
……ううん、それ以上の
意味もあったのかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe. ...Or no,
there was probably
more to it than that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、それはいいとして</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, anyway, moving on.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、そんなことがあったから
私に自分の技を教えてくれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's probably because something
like that had happened that he
taught me all of his artes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分で身を守れるようにって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So I'd be able to defend
myself if I needed to.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>２度と
誘拐されないようにって？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so you wouldn't be
kidnapped ever again?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>父さん、
すごく役にたってるよ、
この技……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And you know, these
artes have come in
really handy, Father...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;って……お姫様？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, so, &lt;Rody&gt;... Are you a princess?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　私が？
面白いこと言う娘だね、
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Me? Haha, you say
some pretty funny
things sometimes, &lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だって
そんなに誘拐されるって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I mean, you
were kidnapped, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お姫様、か……
ある意味、そうかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A princess, huh... Well,
in a certain sense, maybe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの父さんにとっての、
“お姫様”ってね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From my father's point of view,
I was definitely his "princess."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>親にとっては、みんな娘は
“お姫様”なのかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's probably true for
every parent. Their little girl
is always their princess.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meaning you, too, &lt;Mel&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトの“お姫様”？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, I'm Ethos's princess?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あはは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahaha...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>61</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>284916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そう言えば、
この時代にもあれ、
残ってるのかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Speaking of, I
wonder if that's
still around, in this era...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>63</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"That"...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>精霊の森の石に、
父さんの残した言葉が
あってね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, my father carved
some words into a stone
in the Forest of Spirits...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい、できたよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, all done.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うひゃあ……すごく綺麗に
打ち直してくれたんだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa... You did a really good
job of restoring it, didn't you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのさ……私、あんま
持ち合わせないんだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, just to let you know...
I don't have much on me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>金のことなら、心配ない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, if you're talking about
money, don't worry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>69</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな名剣
触らせてもらったんだ。
それだけで元は取れてる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I got to work on such
a famous sword. That's
more than enough return.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>69</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当に！？　サンキュー！
ありがとー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really!? Thanks!
Thank you so, so much!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>71</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いやいや、
それじゃ僕行くよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, don't mention it.
Anyway, I'll be going now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、わたしたちも
行きましょ、お姫様</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, shall we get going
as well, Your Highness?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>73</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　あ、そうだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Ah, right...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行こっか、お姫様</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's be off, Your Highness.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なんだ、あれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...What's that all about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>76</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぼくたち、カヤの外だね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're out of the loop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>77</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
